---
source:
  url: https://madebymandy.substack.com/p/crispy-chilli-hot-honey-beef-bowls
servings: 4
---

== Sweet Potatoes and Avocado
Dice the sweet potatoes into bite-sized pieces.

Dice the avocado into bite-sized pieces.

Drizzle @sweet potatoes{2}(peeled and diced) with @extra virgin olive oil{2%tsp} and season with @salt{} and @pepper{}.

Air fry at 200°C for ~{17.5%minutes} (15–20 min), shaking the basket halfway, until golden and crisp on the edges.

== Crispy Chilli Beef

Heat @chilli oil{1%tbsp} in a #frying pan{} over medium-high heat. Add the @ground beef{500%g} and cook, breaking it up, until browned and crispy, ~{7%minutes} (6–8 min).

Stir in the @tomato paste{2%tsp}, another @chilli oil{1%tbsp} and @honey{1%tbsp}. Cook for ~{1.5%minutes} (1–2 min) until sticky and well coated. Season with salt and pepper to taste.

== Assembly

Divide the crispy sweet potatoes, beef, @cottage cheese{1%cup} and @avocados{2}(diced) between four bowls. Finish with an extra drizzle of @chilli oil{} and @honey{}.
